      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795766402298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "全部のトークンが埋め込みに影響を与え\n突発的な環境音すらも",
      "fontSize": 30.451194756757268,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "全部のトークンが埋め込みに影響を与え\n突発的な環境音すらも",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4_2EszJQkurQCNDQXDV5V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 568.9845278865622,
      "y": -1817.4729738799151,
      "width": 487.2000732421875,
      "height": 76.12798689189317,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 208363927,
      "version": 413,
      "versionNonce": 964455161,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795766429358,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "もし突発的な環境音があるとしても\n影響は局所的に抑えられる",
      "fontSize": 30.451194756757268,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "もし突発的な環境音があるとしても\n影響は局所的に抑えられる",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
